ss continuity plans \\(BCPs\\), and events in Microsoft Word format. This integration resolves the improper page breaks and truncated content that occasionally appeared in PDFs generated by the previous template.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/governance-risk-compliance/integrating-document-designer-with-bcm.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":5,"breadcrumb":["Configure","Business Continuity Management","Governance","Risk","and Compliance"],"tags":["#governance-risk-compliance","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/governance-risk-compliance/integrating-document-designer-with-bcm.md"},
